<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan bank gets 3.25 bln rupees in operation.</title>
<headline>Pakistan bank gets 3.25 bln rupees in operation.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said it had accepted 3.25 billion rupees in its weekly open market operation in Short-Term Federal Bonds on Wednesday. Following are the results:</p>
<p>			 Offered	Accepted     Max cut-off</p>
<p> Outright sales     3,100	  2,950	  17.25 pct</p>
<p> Five-month	     300	    300	  17.25 pct</p>
<p> Three-month	    nil	    nil	     nil</p>
<p> One-month		nil	    nil	     nil</p>
<p> Total (million rupees) 3,400	   3,250</p>
<p>($1 = 40.43 rupees) -- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
